  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  readme: 'How to setup MetaAvatars:

    - Delete old Player

    - Replace with
    MetaPlayer (the ubiq Version)

    - Avatar Manager: Replace AvatarPrefab with
    UbiqMetaAvatar

    - Add AvatarSdkManagerHorizon to the Scene

    - Social/Menu/Canvas/Main
    Panel/Set Avatar Panel/Content/Avatars Page Panel: Deactivate "Avatar Panel Controller"
    and add "Meta Avatar Panel Controller". Apply correft references'
